OL,3,GNEWSAGolf club 'heartbroken' after
OL,4,Athieves steal entire trophy collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of a golf club in the south of
OL,7,FScotland have been left heartbroken
OL,8,Fafter its entire trophy collection was
OL,9,Fstolen.
OL,11,FPolice were called to reports of a
OL,12,Fbreak-in at Minto Golf Club, near
OL,13,FHawick, at about 22:45 on Saturday.
OL,15,FOfficers said the thieves entered the
OL,16,Fclubhouse and took a number of
OL,17,Ftrophies.
